            <ArticleTitle>Combined cardiac surgery and excision of a retrosternal thyroid mass: a case report.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>281-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Retrosternal thyroid mass with posterior mediastinal extension is an extremely rare phenomenon. We describe a combined thyroidectomy, aortic valve replacement, and coronary artery bypass graft surgery on a patient with an asymptomatic retrosternal thyroid mass.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
